## Exclusion decision

Three independent exact-name search passes plus OpenCode, models.dev history, GitHub issue search, Artificial Analysis, BenchLM, and provider-catalog checks yielded capability metadata and lifecycle dates but zero verified public benchmark numbers for this exact route. Project rules therefore require an `.md.excluded` note rather than normalized scores.

